  "body": "### 📦 Download Packages & Compatibility\n\n| Package | Recommended OS | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **`Bhavyam-v1.1-1-universal.apk`** (~22 MB) | **Android 10+ (Android 10 – 16+)** | **Standard Recommended Release.** R8-optimized with uncompressed page-aligned native libraries for instant memory mapping. |\n| **`Bhavyam-v1.1-universal-uncompressed.apk`** (~89 MB) | **Android 10+ (Android 10 – 16+)** | **Raw Release.** Unminified debuggable variant with uncompressed native libraries. |\n| **`Bhavyam-v1.1-android7.apk`** (~17 MB) | **Android 7.0 – 9.0 (Legacy)** | **Legacy Android 7.0+ Variant.** Built with compressed native libraries for older package managers. |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> All three APKs are attached to this release and each one is listed in `SHA256SUMS.txt`. The `1-` prefix on the recommended build is deliberate: the in-app updater downloads the **first** asset whose name ends in `.apk`, and release assets are ordered alphabetically, so **`Bhavyam-v1.1-1-universal.apk`** is always the build that **Check for updates** offers. Download the other two manually if you need them.\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **Notice for Android 7.0 – 9.0 Users (`Bhavyam-v1.1-android7.apk`):**\n> - Hardware GPU glassmorphism / live blur requires Android 12+ and is automatically replaced with translucent dark canvas acrylic styling on older devices.\n> - The media notification uses classic Android media controls rather than Android 13's wavy-progress player.\n> - For any device running Android 10 or newer, please install the standard **`Bhavyam-v1.1-1-universal.apk`** for optimal performance and memory efficiency.\n"
